    "Waiting for approval. Your subscription starts as soon as it's approved — you don't need to buy again." : {
      "comment" : "Ask to Buy: a parent has to approve the purchase.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warte auf die Freigabe. Dein Abo startet, sobald sie da ist – du musst nicht noch einmal kaufen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waiting for approval. Your subscription starts as soon as it's approved — you don't need to buy again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esperando aprobación. Tu suscripción empieza en cuanto se apruebe: no hace falta que compres otra vez."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se așteaptă aprobarea. Abonamentul pornește imediat ce e aprobat — nu trebuie să cumperi din nou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't verify this device. Try again — if it keeps happening, reinstalling the app will reset it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir konnten dieses Gerät nicht überprüfen. Versuch es noch einmal – wenn es weiter passiert, setzt eine Neuinstallation der App das zurück."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We couldn't verify this device. Try again — if it keeps happening, reinstalling the app will reset it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No pudimos verificar este dispositivo. Inténtalo de nuevo; si sigue pasando, reinstalar la app lo reinicia."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N-am putut verifica dispozitivul. Încearcă din nou — dacă se repetă, reinstalarea aplicației rezolvă."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll let you know when your monthly recap is ready and remind you to update your ledger. Functional only — no spam, and you can turn these off anytime in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir sagen dir Bescheid, wenn dein Monatsrückblick fertig ist, und erinnern dich daran, dein Buch zu aktualisieren. Nur Nützliches – kein Spam, und du kannst das jederzeit in den Einstellungen ausschalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We'll let you know when your monthly recap is ready and remind you to update your ledger. Functional only — no spam, and you can turn these off anytime in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Te avisaremos cuando esté listo el resumen del mes y te recordaremos actualizar tu registro. Solo lo útil: nada de spam, y puedes desactivarlo cuando quieras en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Îți dăm de știre când e gata recapitularea lunii și îți amintim să îți actualizezi registrul. Doar lucruri utile — fără spam, și le poți opri oricând din Setări."
          }
        }
      }
    },
